#: mainwindow.cpp:93
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<h3>Rules of Game</h3><p>You are the system administrator and your goal is "
"to connect each computer to the central server.</p><p>Click the right "
"mouse's button for turning the cable in a clockwise direction, and left "
"mouse's button for turning the cable in a counter-clockwise direction.</"
"p><p>Start the LAN with as few turns as possible!</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>Rheolau'r Gêm</h3><p>Chi yw gweinyddwr y cysawd, efo'r amcan o gysylltu "
"pob cyfrifiadur i'r gweinydd canolig. <p>Cliciwch botwm de y llygoden i "
"droi'r cêbl yn glocwedd, a botwm chwith y llygoden i droi'r cêbl yn wrth-"
"glocwedd.<p>Dechreuwch y LAN efo cyn lleied o droadau â phosib!"

